  {"id":"hi6_11","language":"html","difficulty":"intermediate","bug_type":"css","title":"display: contents for Semantic Wrappers","code":".wrapper {\n  display: contents;\n}\n/* .wrapper's children are treated as direct children of .wrapper's parent */","bugs":[]},
  {"id":"hi6_12","language":"html","difficulty":"intermediate","bug_type":"css","title":"aspect-ratio With min/max","code":".card-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n  max-height: 300px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}","bugs":[{"lines":[4],"fix":"  max-block-size: 300px;","explanation":"`max-height` is a physical property and doesn't account for writing modes. Use `max-block-size` for the logical equivalent. Note that combining `aspect-ratio` with `max-height` can also cause the image to not maintain ratio — object-fit handles the image itself, not the box."}]},
